User Story 1:-
As a User I want to buy medicines through online

Acceptance Criteria:-
Given a user is logged in and is willing to buy products. 
When the user selects medicines and provides prescription 
then pharmacist check and approves the prescription and medicines delivered to customer home





User Story 2:-
As a Pharmacist, I would like to know the customer prescriptions. So that I can review prescriptions and send orders

Acceptance Criteria:-
Given a customer has uploaded a prescription, 
when the prescription is submitted, 
then the pharmacist should be able to view and review the prescription and process the medicine order.
